2026-03-10 16:07:34 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:171) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '66435d1d000000001e0310f0', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '睿爸|小学数学鸡娃路线5. 提前校内的示范', 'desc': '很多家长看了“小学数学鸡娃路线”系列后，对于提前校内的“过”把握的不好。因为想学的细是很容易的事情，只要把所有的知识点都当做重点，题题都做再加教辅即可。而过的粗却并不容易操作，因为这需要家长去判断所有知识点的重要程度，从而来决定不同的知识点在提前学时需要学到什么程度。所以这里单独开一篇说说提前校内的“过”。\n\t\n⚠️本文中提前校内学习之后会接小奥学习。\n\t\n⚠️本文中提前校内的最佳适用年级为小学1-4年级，其次为5-6年级，不适合初高中。\n\t\n🔸适用家长：有能力辅导小学校内数学的家长。\n\t\n🔸适用孩子：平级校内测试卷90+，至少85+的孩子。\n\t\n详细内容请查看图片，全文13图。🔝\n\t\n#睿爸[话题]#\xa0\xa0#睿爸小屋[话题]#\xa0\xa0#小学数学[话题]#\xa0\xa0#数学学习[话题]#\xa0#小学数学鸡娃路线', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1715731290000, 'last_update_time': 1715690782000, 'user_id': '5b5f3c584eacab76c425faf2', 'nickname': '睿爸小屋', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/5b5f3cd3d1d3b91ecf920f94.jpg', 'liked_count': '245', 'collected_count': '539', 'comment_count': '27', 'share_count': '103', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/4f1150c4b49f72d971b3d46d95b0a4b4/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7lpq1o0g4a7mfsu5huniatpi3d0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/8691d972773b71427ea5d0c70aba7abb/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7m0c1k0g4a7mfsu5huni9i69nh0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/a9e073ee6a8c2cc33d80279b2f919bcf/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7m24hk004a7mfsu5hunia22j5n8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/7ee281e79e71a01611b574da172b4ee3/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7m4dhk004a7mfsu5hunivid38po!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/11986a01598cbc98c45d065458d28d0e/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mlchm0g4a7mfsu5huni24063fo!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/f891c38c8712fbac7451e6f27d1e5759/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7m6qho0g4a7mfsu5hunipep7dpg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/9e04aa9ac492a9430261996543cd1b50/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7moo1m0g4a7mfsu5huni4nt41ao!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/d417733b0598d1ce437da1daeb5123c5/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mft1k004a7mfsu5huni8c5iiq8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/424d2bbe2a45fb1398e1f652a7692626/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mhqhk0g4a7mfsu5hunimlkul2g!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/4b904e4bdf6249787b7cd955824ef615/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7manhm0g4a7mfsu5huni1232d00!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/63bc9a2f421780d7ceecb10401717f8f/spectrum/1040g34o312pf7mr31q0g4a7mfsu5huni9trstk8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/0c20661dc62e1243640323d2cc59f0b8/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mjpho004a7mfsu5hunisns0lg0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101600/fc28ca123ae1a954e6828a2b226f2bde/spectrum/1040g0k0312pf7mbvhq004a7mfsu5hunirvlc3b8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3', 'tag_list': '睿爸,睿爸小屋,小学数学,数学学习', 'last_modify_ts': 1773130054450, 'note_url': 'https://www.xiaohongshu.com/explore/66435d1d000000001e0310f0?xsec_token=ABNiQ-erXnHMLMlbSjUyV-DUE_6VS0DzT2jR2OJKI31Ss=&xsec_source=pc_search', 'source_keyword': '数学超前学', 'xsec_token': 'ABNiQ-erXnHMLMlbSjUyV-DUE_6VS0DzT2jR2OJKI31Ss='}
