2026-03-10 16:08:27 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:171) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '693d86e4000000001f009c82', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '数学超前学怎么规划，怎么学（3初中阶段）', 'desc': '提前学习数学，培养自学能力，分启蒙、小学、初中三个阶段。初中阶段采用知识点、专项题、总结思路、套卷的步骤，逐步提升能力。家长需耐心鼓励，坚持执行，逐步克服畏难情绪，最终掌握自学方法。#初中数学[话题]# #陪孩子学习[话题]# #教育规划[话题]# #数学[话题]# #家庭教育[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1765639909000, 'last_update_time': 1765639909000, 'user_id': '57ed56e65e87e7283a7e695e', 'nickname': '小梦', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31h4t8tekjo0048nnh2becqau6egajng', 'liked_count': '83', 'collected_count': '154', 'comment_count': '8', 'share_count': '28', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/b7d6f8d309ae0b81e9887ab51c6a32a8/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng8g48nnh2becqaubbp8168!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/a4d9643865a8b8fad7bcac3c201696ff/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vnga048nnh2becqauq0icnb0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/e75255f561d7879f76bbecf03c3a41e2/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng8048nnh2becqau9g5nth8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/53acae527c1d0b2e00d96dede928f885/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vngag48nnh2becqauno314ao!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/80d5bfc49be871fc6090d7ea8e4e7d61/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng7048nnh2becqaunu2nr88!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/53dbe358f327411a8777d0de5f9cca5a/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng9g48nnh2becqauh5688i0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/31f8735dc241c0e92b19394ca01bdd47/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng7g48nnh2becqaujiuqa8o!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/643e0819b175cee6d2271866daeb4631/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vng9048nnh2becqaud03jib0!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/8d6224ad140cdacedad9dff1166867f1/1040g2sg31q1mvt4vngb048nnh2becqau7c5oka8!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101602/dbd64693993