2026-03-10 16:11:11 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '67413ff10000000002005cd0', 'create_time': 1732329457000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '663d7a3e000000001e022716', 'note_title': '数学如何超前学？', 'content': '想问一下怎么安排时间啊？我们每天晚上课内作业都得花两三个小时，更别说妈妈牌作业➕提前学了[笑哭R]', 'user_id': '54e53ed2b4c4d674d1bef563', 'nickname': 'jessssssssica', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/54e53ed2b4c4d674d1bef563.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '1', 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773130271047, 'like_count': '2'}
2026-03-10 16:11:11 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '681df1dc000000000401e798', 'create_time': 1746792925000, 'ip_location': '浙江', 'note_id': '663d7a3e000000001e022716', 'note_title': '数学如何超前学？', 'content': '教材全解太慢太多了，直接做奥数题就等于超前学，', 'user_id': '5a793b3011be1024e9254ebe', 'nickname': '🙇', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31qrfuqg37o004a19t6tj0jlu9r9ei5o?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': '2', 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': 0, 'last_modify_ts': 1773130271049, 'like_count': '0'}
