2026-03-10 17:58:05 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:171) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note] xhs note: {'note_id': '68a57ac2000000001d02012b', 'type': 'normal', 'title': '数学提前学用完的资料存起来还是扔了？', 'desc': '数学提前学，用完的资料存起来还是扔了？我以前都是扔了，一两个月清理一次，。计算口算的资料，包括买回来没用过，用不着的书都是扔了。今天清理书籍。这都是娃做过的，其实蛮有纪念意义的#数学提前学[话题]# #计算[话题]# #小学数学[话题]# #数学思维[话题]# #教辅[话题]# #数学学习[话题]# #小学生的学习习惯[话题]# #五三天天练[话题]# #小学数学[话题]# #口算[话题]#', 'video_url': '', 'time': 1755675330000, 'last_update_time': 1755919185000, 'user_id': '58fa25366a6a694d38ee6069', 'nickname': '知一老师带普娃～', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31bvohk5n0u5g49dvqhijco39d71kqo0', 'liked_count': '201', 'collected_count': '145', 'comment_count': '113', 'share_count': '6', 'ip_location': '', 'image_list': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/f102ca86af155489a726ba2b3948c3ea/notes_pre_post/1040g3k031ld9bovfle6g49dvqhijco394k5o3hg!nd_dft_wlteh_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/64ad48b82130692d3abc7c0735128f53/1040g00831ld9bodalo0g49dvqhijco39pi3iiv8!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/b5352389bc17d4cb147eec00a8b15005/1040g00831ld9sg7nlm0049dvqhijco39jk8hfjg!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/2f51a58d77a19fbf5236e6caee00b992/1040g2sg31ld9sheule6g49dvqhijco39473ilvg!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/bf67eda2aaa5999d31595f10a87ae534/1040g00831ld9bodalo0049dvqhijco39bptap70!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/3650151d72aaedcb4b25bbfd4331614b/1040g00831ld9bodalo5g49dvqhijco39rotbs0o!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/711518e279e3119ff62d5b2b0047ff9d/1040g00831ld9bodalo6g49dvqhijco398katmpg!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/69fe3f591e2780e4ca96c8a26ba2dbfa/1040g00831ld9bodalo1g49dvqhijco39moji1fg!nd_dft_wgth_webp_3,http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101753/cf26c507e8b9d1e2807199f2874eacf6/1040g00831ld9bodalo3g49dvqhijco39rgpmido!nd_dft_wg