2026-03-10 18:00:45 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69972213000000000f02f4a8', 'create_time': 1771512341000, 'ip_location': '重庆', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '这两套怎么样，我买了，娃四年级小学的还没看完。我大概看了哈小学的，定理公式比现在的教材清晰明了，现在的教材对娃的灵活运用要求比较高。', 'user_id': '68a6ee98000000001901d930', 'nickname': 'Asher', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/645b7e371fc3de4c930eff9d.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': 'http://sns-webpic-qc.xhscdn.com/202603101800/dae4d9264f151cb38a79374075003ccc/comment/1040g4b831sp94uq4lkd05q56tqc6bm9gpi2ta9o!nd_whgt34_webp_wm_1', 'parent_comment_id': '6908abb6000000003901dc94', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136845123, 'like_count': '0'}
