2026-03-10 18:00:50 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6932796d000000001702ebf1', 'create_time': 1764915566000, 'ip_location': '上海', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '也不是这么说。奥数偏复杂思维，超前学纯粹拼学习逻辑，超前决定你容量大小，思维复杂度决定量的多少。', 'user_id': '67175722000000001d0334de', 'nickname': 'Kaiv凯威老师爱数学', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31a667iak72005ponash7ed6uk7691sg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6932784d0000000016026c7e', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136850087, 'like_count': '7'}
