2026-03-10 18:01:05 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6854cea1000000000d0169af', 'create_time': 1750388385000, 'ip_location': '山东', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '应用，还有以教代学', 'user_id': '5de5df4a0000000001001442', 'nickname': '嘉瑞妈妈', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo3110s4b71madg5nf5rt508522c830f1g?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '68533aac000000002000f1d2', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136865853, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:01:06 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '69544f210000000005039ab9', 'create_time': 1767132961000, 'ip_location': '北京', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '请问应用是刷题吗？以教代学是怎么操作呢', 'user_id': '58aab89d50c4b473431d1bdd', 'nickname': '小声嘟囔', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31a6979j9nc004965ros9q6uthf9nj38?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6854cea1000000000d0169af', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136866014, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:01:06 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '697f0f14000000000600e84c', 'create_time': 1769934612000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '应用是在刷题中体现，以教代学应该是让孩子输出，让孩子做老师的角色扮演，让他讲知识概括及思路。个人观点，请多指教[害羞R]', 'user_id': '5b652ef1f7e8b97cb80c2941', 'nickname': '英子食养小札记', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31q57a5or70004a955dnf2aa1amrhcg0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '69544f210000000005039ab9', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136866020, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:01:11 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '684a7d39000000002002dc50', 'create_time': 1749712185000, 'ip_location': '上海', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '理解了未知数就没问题。方程是历史的更迭，知道车比马跑得快，选择车是人的本能，确保相关知识学明白了就可上。', 'user_id': '67175722000000001d0334de', 'nickname': 'Kaiv凯威老师爱数学', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31a667iak72005ponash7ed6uk7691sg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '684a767c0000000020032b90', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136871698, 'like_count': '1'}
2026-03-10 18:01:11 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '684a8b2d000000002001345a', 'create_time': 1749715757000, 'ip_location': '广东', 'note_id': '6821d8f5000000000303a851', 'note_title': '数学超前学入门思路规划', 'content': '谢谢回复！他现在初步学会列一元一次方程，考虑要不要继续学下去。', 'user_id': '5bcb28c0f90c5d00016131ad', 'nickname': '皮呦', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/2b4cefbb01e0a0824f5c173dde7f98b2.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '684a7d39000000002002dc50', 'last_modify_ts': 1773136871845, 'like_count': '0'}
