2026-03-10 18:08:21 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '67b9d2ee0000000018033990', 'create_time': 1740231406000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '67b953c80000000029026a42', 'note_title': '只有我敢说实话吗？', 'content': '北京高考听说占50分，阅读文章来源原版期刊原版论文，走新概念不好应对', 'user_id': '616b0a7e000000000202708a', 'nickname': '拉宝拽宝', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo3186qakq2jq005obb19v0ks4a1q2dbfo?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67b9c07d0000000016035d74', 'last_modify_ts': 1773137301446, 'like_count': '6'}
2026-03-10 18:08:27 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '67b9d6cd000000001603091c', 'create_time': 1740232397000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '67b953c80000000029026a42', 'note_title': '只有我敢说实话吗？', 'content': '英语的核心是听力口语', 'user_id': '671a6006000000000d024434', 'nickname': '爱丽丝', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31nrfadgj580g5poqc033ch1k73ejtr0?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67b9c07d0000000016035d74', 'last_modify_ts': 1773137307286, 'like_count': '2'}
