2026-03-10 18:18:02 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '671b5dcf000000001b034f5d', 'create_time': 1729846735000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '66606f49000000000d00e3d6', 'note_title': '小学四年级每天如何安排数学提前学', 'content': '虽然我没提前学，但我承认作为家长我应该向您学习[握手R]', 'user_id': '55dc64015894460ece6e35b7', 'nickname': '一鲸落万物生', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6274d41b8e29a0765a0f7df2.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6661983a0000000005027b2a', 'last_modify_ts': 1773137882218, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:18:02 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6742ffa7000000001b02565a', 'create_time': 1732444071000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '66606f49000000000d00e3d6', 'note_title': '小学四年级每天如何安排数学提前学', 'content': '我也特别重视我娃的数学，不提前学怕她后期学不懂[笑哭R]', 'user_id': '661a006200000000030306d4', 'nickname': '豆子Zoey', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6713e8314262cc30adaf8eec.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6661983a0000000005027b2a', 'last_modify_ts': 1773137882247, 'like_count': '1'}
