2026-03-10 18:23:45 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6838dba2000000000b014c86', 'create_time': 1748556706000, 'ip_location': '江苏', 'note_id': '6607e81a000000001b00974d', 'note_title': '初中回头看，小学后悔太浪费时间了', 'content': '对，卷成这样，关键是没有家长拖底，凭孩子自己，以后也很难找到好工作', 'user_id': '57f11c6650c4b41775876fb9', 'nickname': '含💦', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31m2697dil05g48nttee6crtp51tpvb8?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '660d826a0000000019029a05', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138225895, 'like_count': '2'}
