2026-03-10 18:24:03 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '667b72e6000000000d00e19b', 'create_time': 1719366375000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '6607e81a000000001b00974d', 'note_title': '初中回头看，小学后悔太浪费时间了', 'content': '积少成多，一定要相信坚持的力量。每天哪怕1-2个单词，利用聊天散步做电梯的时间', 'user_id': '6049ec2d0000000001001e8b', 'nickname': 'Ruby', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/6049ec2d0000000001001e8b.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6628a4560000000013025618', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138243272, 'like_count': '0'}
