2026-03-10 18:25:24 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '67904d710000000021022173', 'create_time': 1737510257000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '678903a1000000001901b56b', 'note_title': '提前学是捷径还是弯路？99%的家长都搞错了！', 'content': '先能上高中再说', 'user_id': '5c9c8344000000001701408d', 'nickname': '小红薯67E6C246', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/645b7e371fc3de4c930eff9d.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '678bf9950000000022004225', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138324013, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:25:24 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '67904dba0000000018026705', 'create_time': 1737510330000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '678903a1000000001901b56b', 'note_title': '提前学是捷径还是弯路？99%的家长都搞错了！', 'content': '提前学绝对是有必要的！尤其是英语提前学。你想想看，小学是3门；初中、高中那得多少门了？如果不提前学，怎么高的过来', 'user_id': '5c9c8344000000001701408d', 'nickname': '小红薯67E6C246', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/645b7e371fc3de4c930eff9d.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '678bf9950000000022004225', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138324037, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:25:24 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6790bab8000000000b03a4e7', 'create_time': 1737538232000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '678903a1000000001901b56b', 'note_title': '提前学是捷径还是弯路？99%的家长都搞错了！', 'content': '你去看看小学课表，有多少是跟三个主科无关且不考试的课时[笑哭R]', 'user_id': '624c298800000000100077d8', 'nickname': '小狐狸', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/411309441983cdc4ce073ff8da73b5b6.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '67904dba0000000018026705', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138324062, 'like_count': '0'}
2026-03-10 18:25:29 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '6790bce500000000210221fa', 'create_time': 1737538789000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '678903a1000000001901b56b', 'note_title': '提前学是捷径还是弯路？99%的家长都搞错了！', 'content': '主课老师也不傻。我儿子就经常抱怨体育/音乐课等被老师占了。还有德法课就是班主任兼的，结果不讲讲数学。哈哈\n', 'user_id': '5c9c8344000000001701408d', 'nickname': '小红薯67E6C246', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/645b7e371fc3de4c930eff9d.jpg?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '6790bab8000000000b03a4e7', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138329036, 'like_count': '0'}
