2026-03-10 18:25:51 MediaCrawler INFO (__init__.py:234) - [store.xhs.update_xhs_note_comment] xhs note comment:{'comment_id': '678bc36c000000002200b1d8', 'create_time': 1737212781000, 'ip_location': None, 'note_id': '678903a1000000001901b56b', 'note_title': '提前学是捷径还是弯路？99%的家长都搞错了！', 'content': '深度学习是哪种程度 可以具体举一个例子吗', 'user_id': '5a7ae43ae8ac2b6242d1590b', 'nickname': '小红薯_8516', 'avatar': 'https://sns-avatar-qc.xhscdn.com/avatar/1040g2jo31mtc3ith58004a1b19i3km8b5tpnl1g?imageView2/2/w/120/format/jpg', 'sub_comment_count': 0, 'pictures': '', 'parent_comment_id': '678b003e000000001a03a1ed', 'last_modify_ts': 1773138351748, 'like_count': '1'}
